        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek S50001, Stainless Steel Round Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Round Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt features a prominent, contemporary thumbturn. It has a brushed stainless steel finish. This round single cylinder deadbolt has a contemporary silhouette that makes it a great choice for renovations.  It is easy to install and will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 3 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. This is a single cylinder deadbolt so the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Round Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Stainless steel strike.</li>\r\n<li>Stainless steel collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Contemporary Round Brushed Stainless Steel Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2.40\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: .62\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Overall Projection: 1.18\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Thumbturn Projection: .75\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
